@ToDoList_HostAddress = http://localhost:5198

### Get all tasks
GET {{ToDoList_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{ToDoList_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Build a Todo API with EF Core"
}

### Get a task by ID
GET {{ToDoList_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
Accept: application/json

### Update a task
PUT {{ToDoList_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Complete the CRUD API",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{ToDoList_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
